[{"title":"钱逊叔侍郎奉京师旧坟改葬天柱谨成挽诗一首","author":"吕本中","text":"钱氏霸吴越，功德在斯民。\n逊王早退居，身退道益尊。\n至今二百年，盛事传后昆。\n文采震本朝，岂惟光一门。\n后来翰林公，又以直声闻。\n累叶其外家，家世悉殊勋。\n善恶久乃效，其报于此分。\n裔孙杰立者，迎丧自中原。\n遂令扰攘后，得安久旅魂。\n依依天柱山，不必京洛尘。\n死者如有知，当言吾有孙。\n小人托末契，所恨老不文。\n睹此一时盛，忍终无一言。\n越水流不竭，越山旱不昏。\n孝子亦不匮，锡类到礽云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12699,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重阳日西兴寄临安亲旧","author":"吕本中","text":"我来西兴口，君在龙山旁。\n如何阻一水，不共作重阳。\n别浦潮犹白，深秋菊未黄。\n遥知对杯酌，不记是他乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12700,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范伯言药隐","author":"吕本中","text":"烈士故徇名，中民但荣官。\n宁知陋巷士，坚坐有馀欢。\n出从圣师游，归坐守一箪。\n出门视天壤，密迩心自宽。\n范侯懒仕宦，决意归西山。\n西山有药隐，此地可盘桓。\n誓将从古人，上追孔与颜。\n有田可以耕，有屋可以安。\n宁能伴儿曹，日夜不得闲。\n我亦倦游者，世味更百难。\n梦寐想君家，父子兄弟间。\n便当卜邻居，一生长往还。\n相依得情话，出语清肺肝。\n后生有郢质，更为斲其漫。\n君行问安否，此盟当未寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12701,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵祖文盘谷图","author":"吕本中","text":"赵郎落笔写盘谷，正是太平无事时。\n今日太行那有此，满山樵采尽痴儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12702,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送胡明仲知永州","author":"吕本中","text":"君行西游浮沅湘，洞庭岳麓天一方。\n岳前老人望君久，岁晚不嫌归路长。\n晴天万里去鸿鹄，韫玉未售犹深藏。\n远行固是君素愿，多蓄奇谋羞自献。\n后生纷纷了目前，大策定非凡所见。\n簿书汩没渠自忙，道里溪岖我不倦。\n百州东下例无涧，要君嶷然如断山。\n我老无用逢多艰，敢复著脚尘埃间。\n胸次偪塞良未宽，日夜矫首须君还。\n运斤成风君不难，不使世人漫鼻端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12703,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙首之短堂","author":"吕本中","text":"孙郎囊空意且满，因谓身长才则短。\n以短名堂堂未成，长短是非俱不管。\n严州一见鬓仓浪，赠我新诗如夜光。\n何时到君短堂上，更话如今归兴长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12704,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠孙首之","author":"吕本中","text":"子穷非一时，所历固长久。\n自从太平时，以至戎马后。\n今兹益穷甚，所至但缩手。\n遂令甑生尘，不止衿见肘。\n未能脱身去，且作避地走。\n金盘贮火齐，熟视不一取。\n溪船下涛江，亦未还南斗。\n固知松柏生，必不在培塿。\n见我严州城，世事懒到口。\n念子抱奇才，有节空自守。\n箪瓢在陋巷，世亦如此不。\n乘离勿重言，寒甚且饮酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12705,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱成伯秀野堂","author":"吕本中","text":"客愁固多岐，我怀亦萧散。\n连年寻故人，见子二水岸。\n官居少闲暇，岁月忽已换。\n有堂名秀野，未入俗眼看。\n得名自君子，可当清净观。\n未能艺桃李，且自饱藜苋。\n荒凉城一隅，初不越门限。\n脱身少年场，念此已熟烂。\n嗟予老病侵，阅世盖多难。\n相逢默无语，自足洗忧患。\n穷冬足雨雪，近市乏薪炭。\n时来正堂堂，尚得一笑粲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12706,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次秀亭韵二首 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"忽见新亭起废基，暮云疏雨两霏霏。\n凭栏一望长江远，凿石新开小径微。\n治世从今可招隐，至人何苦更藏辉。\n使君不厌宾朋集，正为飘流到眼稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12707,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次秀亭韵二首 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"舟车来往闹回环，今日陪公得暂闲。\n渐喜著身人迹外，胜如随众马蹄间。\n萦纡细数溪头路，苍翠遥看雨后山。\n正恐朝廷须旧物，不容常此面孱颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12708,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘棠楼","author":"吕本中","text":"高楼面面好，举目是溪山。\n急水泻湍濑，诸峰呈髻鬟。\n聊为半日出，得伴使君闲。\n作者风流在，承平气象还。\n身虽住世网，心已离尘寰。\n未厌陪游数，唯愁觅句悭。\n高风虽在望，逸韵恐难攀。\n咫尺蓬莱路，惟公指顾间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12709,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师奴病化 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"伴我闲中气味长，竹舆游历遍诸方。\n火边每与人争席，睡起偏嫌犬吠床。\n能与儿童较几许，贤于臧获便相忘。\n他生尚欲随吾在，要奉香炉漉水囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12710,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师奴病化 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"受戒不捕鼠，听经如欲应。\n谁知两溪畔，今日送亡僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12711,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行至桐庐","author":"吕本中","text":"乘舟待潮发，一日到桐庐。\n物色寒初甚，溪山画不如。\n往来真是梦，亲旧不须书。\n犹胜鸱夷在，时容托后车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12712,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示儿","author":"吕本中","text":"忍穷吾有味，雕句汝无功。\n客舍嚣尘里，春随浩荡中。\n初无买山费，真与住庵同。\n更想颜氏宅，箪瓢亦屡空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12713,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈朝奉坐化","author":"吕本中","text":"东风吹雨欲翻盆，杏树前头柳暗村。\n试问老人何处去，夜来新月又黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12714,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"严州春晓 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"居闲病常撄，出郭春已老。\n微雨净新绿，转觉原野好。\n故人各漂散，颇恨来不早。\n尚有壁间诗，犹堪写怀抱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12715,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"严州春晓 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"是月足阴晦，暮春常苦寒。\n闭门犹疾病，春物岂相干。\n坚坐客已少，长贫心自安。\n幽兰有花在，尚肯结馀欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12716,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子将为三衢之行下塔僧惠道求诗留题因成绝句遗之","author":"吕本中","text":"欲过城东病不能，飞檐高栋想层层。\n半年梦作严州住，一首诗留塔下僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12717,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将适三衢而七弟欲往临安临行作诗奉送","author":"吕本中","text":"弟要题诗别，人还劝我留。\n如何南去路，更送北行舟。\n处事须远略，择交当广求。\n秋风理归棹，为我上衢州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12718,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"椿阁 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"往时椿阁老，盛德传乡闾。\n至今风流在，遗芳殊未疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12719,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"椿阁 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"有孙仁者静，远近伏共贤。\n定知建德民，祝令如翁年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12720,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弋阳魏令赏音亭","author":"吕本中","text":"高亭已寂寞，山水自清音。\n主人去已久，此意谁复寻。\n梦回还旧观，川上有微吟。\n于焉继前作，因见平生心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12721,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建安熊述之为令建德不言而民治将适三衢留诗美之二首 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"熊卿治建德，隐几心若水。\n民肥吏乾枯，亦不用笞箠。\n问子何能然，此岂力可使。\n建安今多贤，于子可见尔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12722,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建安熊述之为令建德不言而民治将适三衢留诗美之二首 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"建安固多贤，故人刘与胡。\n山川古秀润，珠生崖不枯。\n我病日已懒，触事见迂疏。\n行当脱身去，一廛从子居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12723,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟古乐府","author":"吕本中","text":"高堂陈八音，同听不同乐。\n狂飙送鸿鹄，万里翔寥廓。\n一去三十年，事事非前约。\n当时绿绮琴，尘埃无处著。\n时节非不久，此意但如昨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12724,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己未重阳","author":"吕本中","text":"病无佳思只深藏，漫绕东篱菊未黄。\n最是一年秋好处，可能无酒过重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12725,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李珹拙轩","author":"吕本中","text":"念彼巧者劳，知此拙者安。\n拙者固无营，一生长得闲。\n子岂真拙者，托此以自安。\n何尝曳长裾，顾肯卑小官。\n世人极变态，翻手覆手间。\n子独如不闻，默坐安如山。\n九衢走红尘，百事不相干。\n我老始见子，古井久不澜。\n赠子拙轩诗，留子静处看。\n当蒙一笑许，敢言愁肺肝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12726,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清慎轩","author":"吕本中","text":"清慎轩中一事无，午窗高枕似吾庐。\n世人称意何须道，乃祖风流正不疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12727,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将往城南观音寺阻雨未果","author":"吕本中","text":"野寺他年别，溪山浪作秋。\n初凉颇宜出，小雨故妨游。\n僧老浑无念，田荒近不收。\n犹思五更忏，清切胜蛮讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12728,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余迪漫浪斋","author":"吕本中","text":"颜子在陋巷，无一当其心。\n日惟圣之学，正自惜分阴。\n子生千载后，此意尚能寻。\n斋虽名漫浪，迹岂计浮沉。\n文字浩今古，不受俗务侵。\n端如贮美酒，妙处当自斟。\n临卷忽有得，如来君义临。\n即此是圣域，子行无滞淫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12729,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题四首 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"我病无能到处穷，子才安得尚漂蓬。\n如何共饮重阳酒，相对无言似乃翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12730,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题四首 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"重阳共采东篱菊，却似乃翁年少时。\n顾我无能甘老病，相寻唯有向来诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12731,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题四首 其三","author":"吕本中","text":"闻钟即起待天明，客舍无聊坐五更。\n何日长风破巨浪，看渠万里出门行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12732,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题四首 其四","author":"吕本中","text":"平生饱我饭脱粟，静夜不眠寻细书。\n可见乌衣诸子弟，从来志业不如渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12733,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"边愁 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"胡人吹短笛，一半是离声。\n想得南飞鸟，云间亦厌听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12734,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"边愁 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"秋声晚来急，边塞乍寒时。\n不似江南日，愁多只自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12735,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招范四弟","author":"吕本中","text":"凉风忽满箑，江汉有归心。\n顾我病如昨，怜君穷至今。\n苦嫌归梦短，不厌酒杯深。\n试问玉川老，何时许降临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12736,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"衢州路中","author":"吕本中","text":"今日衢州路，师奴不共行。\n阿童浑似汝，只是太粗生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12737,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆福州旧居菊花","author":"吕本中","text":"问讯阶前菊，如今属阿谁。\n祗应风露底，犹记摘残枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12738,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求赵表之墨","author":"吕本中","text":"超然堂中墨如戟，支撑宗门渠有力。\n参得诸方一味禅，以此示人人不识。\n病夫见之喜折屐，便欲投诗恐无益。\n主人不吝是家风，会见琅琅送圭璧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12739,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陋巷","author":"吕本中","text":"陋巷客自稀，短日寒未到。\n感君时一来，得以慰怀抱。\n论文有根柢，落笔清且奥。\n如歌五弦琴，促轸有馀操。\n黄花开正繁，薄酒可相劳。\n请君寻此盟，妙处同一造。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12740,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示闻生","author":"吕本中","text":"形容落魄犹须酒，疾病因寻久废诗。\n忽见闻郎七字句，却如王谢少年时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12741,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简何居厚","author":"吕本中","text":"我乏济胜具，子怀经世才。\n寒窗得一笑，陋巷绝纤埃。\n白酒难充醉，黄花只强开。\n更怜无事日，时有好诗来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12742,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人送酒","author":"吕本中","text":"他乡逢故人，已觉意气盛。\n得君双榼酒，起我终日病。\n清如两龚洁，气出徐邈圣。\n乃知无功乡，欲往有捷径。\n一杯我已足，不必待历聘。\n扁舟下东阳，此计或未定。\n尚欲寻旧盟，短拙恐未称。\n先生肯降临，时扫一室净。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12743,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蔡九弟十四弟到行在","author":"吕本中","text":"苦怀吾表弟，别久费相思。\n爱客能忘酒，长贫不废诗。\n每蒙高士喜，终少贵人知。\n试问游吴兴，何如在蜀时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12744,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠蔡九弟十四弟","author":"吕本中","text":"年来疾病日衰颓，忽报山中两弟来。\n径欲相从营一醉，未须辛苦便轻回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12745,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中","author":"吕本中","text":"贷米供晨炊，尚欠数束薪。\n平生甘此味，此去未为贫。\n新霜已严厉，况我病经旬。\n但守此心足，无为思古人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12746,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中曾端伯见访","author":"吕本中","text":"不见仓曹十五年，江城相遇各华颠。\n何时更践邻居约，判断诸方五味禅。\n浮生扰扰乱初定，久病昏昏闲始便。\n欲问小童寻大隗，胜于猛将画凌烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12747,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题","author":"吕本中","text":"一任衡门可雀罗，时容攲枕听悬河。\n因君小试屠龙手，要与午窗降睡魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12748,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曾吉父","author":"吕本中","text":"吾道从来到处穷，八珍常与一箪同。\n子房故是青云士，圮上乃逢黄石翁。\n圣学有传为可喜，宦游少味自无功。\n亦知湖岭如江浙，尽在先生指顾中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12749,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次曾吉父兰溪三绝 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"夜窗相对不成眠，苦为离愁定不然。\n政以苍生未苏息，思君日夕望回船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12750,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次曾吉父兰溪三绝 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"春信先寻岭上梅，两年零落待君开。\n非关使节须重到，自是溪山未遣回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12751,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次曾吉父兰溪三绝 其三","author":"吕本中","text":"久觉藏身不厌深，旧游风物要追寻。\n书来肯附铜鱼使，记我今年病不禁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12752,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"穷腊有怀","author":"吕本中","text":"冰霜抵穷腊，伏枕久亦倦。\n思公如和风，咫尺未得见。\n人生无贤愚，各自有志愿。\n但得所趣同，公固不我贱。\n何须肱九折，始见金百鍊。\n平安望中原，栖息各异县。\n尚欲从公游，衰年保穷健。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12753,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中闻诸范日赴饮会","author":"吕本中","text":"诸公相随日酣饮，我病昏昏困衾枕。\n人生苦乐故不同，世味再寻如拾沈。\n良医更在肱九折，曾子从来日三省。\n不离方丈走诸方，万事只如驴觑井。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12754,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"深居","author":"吕本中","text":"深居如山林，初不识城市。\n尘凝喜事少，犬吠知客至。\n生涯付衰疾，日力破昏睡。\n欣然一笑足，自省甘若荠。\n收身当在早，过此恐少味。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12755,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆大悲阁成","author":"吕本中","text":"自离闽岭罢参禅，疾病深藏不计年。\n尚得闲人相印可，隔门惟有白衣仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12756,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠人","author":"吕本中","text":"坚卧因循欲过冬，故人无复马牛风。\n得君好句能忘病，笑我长饥不讳穷。\n清梦肯嫌斋舍冷，破囊常伴酒杯空。\n新正所愿长穷健，剩作歌诗准备公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12757,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送广东漕范子仪","author":"吕本中","text":"我为三衢居，君作番禺行。\n君行我方病，岁序仍峥嵘。\n岭海未寂寞，斯民则憔悴。\n得君镇临之，固可以卒岁。\n嗟君盛德后，穷独与我同。\n比年数见之，长在寒苦中。\n番禺盛宾僚，莫如元帅贤。\n君行问安否，道我如昔然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12758,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜闻诸生读书因成寄赵十七侄","author":"吕本中","text":"纷纷药裹了新正，北望兰溪不数程。\n且喜诸生会勤苦，夜窗如子读书声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12759,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"吕本中","text":"所至留连不计程，两年坚卧厌南征。\n荒城日短溪山静，野寺人稀鹳鹤鸣。\n药裹向人闲自好，文书到眼病犹明。\n较量定力差精进，夜夜蒲团坐五更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12760,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简李巽伯","author":"吕本中","text":"爱酒旧无敌，能诗新有声。\n荒城时过我，长句屡寻盟。\n厌病时招客，因行不计程。\n祗应有馀暇，未肯赋闲情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12761,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"追记昔年正月十日宣城出城至广教","author":"吕本中","text":"尝忆他年在宛陵，好山松竹面层层。\n江城气候犹含雪，草市人家已挂灯。\n每怪愁肠难贮酒，时随拄杖出寻僧。\n如今转觉衰颓甚，病坐南窗冷欲冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12762,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中上元","author":"吕本中","text":"病久仍多事，深居未识春。\n殷勤今夜雨，且为阻游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12763,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三衢上元","author":"吕本中","text":"俗事纷纷避作烦，梦中时厌雨声喧。\n但看闲客时来去，胜说群儿手覆翻。\n事业不同俱可笑，形骸如此尚何言。\n他年更有相逢话，同是三衢过上元。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":12764,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]